          %p
            whose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+adjoint"} right adjoint
            may be thought of as the right
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/induced+action"} induced action
            or equivalently as right
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+extension"} Kan extension
            along the
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sSet"} sSet
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+functor"} enriched functor
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo *
                    %mo →
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mi 𝒢
