          %h4#MonoidalModelStructure Monoidal model structure
          %p
            We discuss (Prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExistenceOfMonoidalModelStructure"}
            below) induced
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+model+category"} monoidal model category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure"} structure
            on the Borel model structure, in the generality of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
            any (cofibrantly generated) simplicial model structure (as
            = succeed ")," do
              %a{:href => "#DefinitionInCombSimpModCat"} above
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+simplicial+model+structure"} monoidal simplicial model structure
          %p
          #ExistenceOfMonoidalModelStructure.num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
